          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And also I have withholden the rain from you, when",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet three months to the harvest: and I caused it to rain upon one city, and caused it not to rain upon another city: one piece was rained upon, and the piece whereupon it rained not withered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So two",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "three cities wandered unto one city, to drink water; but they were not satisfied: yet have ye not returned unto me, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have smitten you with blasting and mildew: when your gardens and your vineyards and your fig trees and your olive trees increased, the palmerworm devoured",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet have ye not returned unto me, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
