          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus will I do unto thee, O Israel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because I will do this unto thee, prepare to meet thy God, O Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, lo, he that formeth the mountains, and createth the wind, and declareth unto man what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his thought, that maketh the morning darkness, and treadeth upon the high places of the earth, The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.4.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.4.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", The God of hosts,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
